                <p><i class="fa fa-check text-primary me-3"></i><b>Verified Listings</b>– Only authentic and genuine properties.</p>
                <p><i class="fa fa-check text-primary me-3"></i> <b>Easy & Secure Deals</b>– Ensuring smooth and secure transactions.</p>
                <p><i class="fa fa-check text-primary me-3"></i><b>Buy, Sell & Rent</b> – Share your property and connect with potential buyers.</p>
                       
                       
            </div>
